<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chubb upgraded by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chubb upgraded by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Chubb Corp to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it maintained its long-term rating on Chubb at buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
